    "turn_text": "and you know with the with the year with the with the c r that we uh... we expect to be approved this week and curious if you think that's the with the government shut down is is uh... is off the table right now the big sticking point was the border wall there hasn't been a lot of talk though about what to do about resources and or policy regarding migrant separations and i think Until your trip and until the tragic death of a seven-year-old in U.S. custody, I think there was a lot of kind of feeling that this whole thing had been solved. What needs to be done now? What can be done legislatively? And do you feel like there's any prospect for pursuing something maybe early in the new year?",
