      },
      {
        "text": "Pursuing Medicare for All signals a principled ideological commitment rather than pragmatic compromise.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Republican opposition makes bipartisan cooperation unlikely or ineffective.",
        "confidence": 0.89
