  {
    "episode_id": 77296,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77296.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 88,
    "turn_text": "All right. Thanks, Senator. Well, Mary, I do think Senator Merkley will be an interesting 2020 choice. It is a name you're hearing from a progressive activist. He's pretty well known in that community. He isn't that well known nationally. We talked a little bit about the Medicare for all issues and issue. He's been out on front on it. He did more than maybe any other senator and bringing attention to that child separation issue. He was part of one of the first rounds of trips down there and getting people to pay attention. And the progressive side of the field is going to be wide open.",
