  {
    "episode_id": 77296,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77296.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 89,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and it will be interesting to see how he makes that decision. Look, not only is there going to be a ton of legislation happening here in the beginning of next year, a lot of investigations, but you have so many members of Congress who have now said they're weighing over this holiday whether or not to run, which means that we're going to see a flood of announcements one way or another likely in the next coming weeks as well. So something else for us all appear to be keeping a close eye on and chasing. And the Democratic field is so huge. It's massive and so wide ranging and there's so many different people who are interested in raising their hand. The question is, can one of them appeal to what is now such a diverse party?",
